<span class="mention-tr tr Latn" lang="ru-Latn">
   Box
  </span>
<span class="mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren">
   )
  </span>
  ), except for some common set expressions.
  <sup class="reference" id="cite_ref-1">
<a href="#cite_note-1">
<span class="cite-bracket">
     [
    </span>
    1
    <span class="cite-bracket">
     ]
    </span>
</a>
</sup>
</li>
</ul>
